## Why This Is Asked
This question tests the ability to architect a production-grade, multimodal NLP system that balances real-time performance with privacy requirements while supporting multilingual deployment.

## Key Concepts
- Multimodal fusion strategies and on-device inference
- Privacy-preserving cloud inference with encrypted fallback
- Latency budgeting and threshold calibration across languages
- Model explainability and fairness/drift monitoring

## Code Example
